{"steam_appid":2828710,"steam_name":"Valor Mortis","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2828710/1733018260/4b5df60c8f70638036801a53524a4d585281449f/1791245608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791556780","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257448038/a6add8b5cd8ab7bc17aac8f61fc6258e997d4b1f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791556780","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/11d8d079855974437fbda10fa80c9db27c8f8b75/ss_11d8d079855974437fbda10fa80c9db27c8f8b75.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791924072","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/6d8ffdc4542763619c8d09ba0d986edbd67c7aa7/ss_6d8ffdc4542763619c8d09ba0d986edbd67c7aa7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791924072","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/8011321f88ddce6e0b2aff5bc79770ff6012bae4/ss_8011321f88ddce6e0b2aff5bc79770ff6012bae4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791924072","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/9355ee1b4fd2764210c2b18111e4811cab08f48a/ss_9355ee1b4fd2764210c2b18111e4811cab08f48a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791924072","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/4470f8c5367b2df36733998c77bfe44ff04eeb3f/ss_4470f8c5367b2df36733998c77bfe44ff04eeb3f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791924072"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/4d2e61aca32b0f745e889a659ef10d80.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are William, a soldier of the Grande Armée brought back from a battlefield grave. But the Europe you awaken to is not the one you sacrificed for. A mysterious plague now sweeps the continent, and you have been reborn with its corrupting power pulsing through your veins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/3285ac753a07a8070e9c7289de559a8c.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.poster.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.webm?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/1f273b0f18feb4f59d88960f217685de.mp4?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death is a chance to grow stronger. Master a combat system of parries, dashes, and visceral finishers across a variety of weapons. Channel your power to enhance attacks and unlock new supernatural abilities to inflict upon your enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/af900e204940ebc01dd7343137838692.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=133 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.poster.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.webm?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/f1c079143221c5821d29d1d53dfc2baa.mp4?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a 19th-century alternate history where the costs of endless war have corrupted the landscape. Use your newfound mobility to outmaneuver the plague-ridden abominations of Napoleon’s Eternal Guard and uncover environmental secrets that may increase your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d596e9c488fae182baddcf2baefd6978.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.poster.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.webm?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/d4f402ddb3004aaf0d2d38e9f011e464.mp4?t=1791924072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a compelling story where historical figures and realities intertwine with elements of horror and the supernatural. Explore beyond the dark corners of the world to discover the truth behind the plague and your unholy resurrection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828710/extras/b562c1b65dea1dd20f53e3cfdc2a4897.avif?t=1791924072\" width=780 height=306 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600 / Core i5-10600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 5600 XT / GTX 1660Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. 30FPS @ 1080p on Low (with upscaling).</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 5800X / Core i5-13400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 6800 / RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. 60FPS @ 1440p on Medium (with upscaling).</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG"],"developers":["One More Level"],"publishers":["Lyrical Games","One More Level"],"release_date":"Oct 13, 2026"}